#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/events.rst:2
msgid "Pushing events to the dashboard"
msgstr "將事件推播至儀表板"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/events.rst:4
msgid ""
"The dashboard needs to be told the moment motion fires -- not on the next "
"poll. That's what Server-Sent Events do: one HTTP connection from the "
"browser to the cam, and the cam pushes events down it whenever they happen."
msgstr ""
"儀表板需要在動作觸發的那一刻就被告知——而非在下一次輪詢時。這正是 Server-Sent Events 的作用：一個從瀏覽器到相機的 HTTP "
"連線，相機便在事件發生時隨即將事件往下推送。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/events.rst:10
msgid "A motion-detector coroutine"
msgstr "動作偵測器協程"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/events.rst:12
msgid ""
"A third top-level task runs alongside the capture loop and the HTTP server. "
"It waits for each new frame, runs a difference against the previous frame, "
"and -- when the change is above the configured threshold -- bumps a counter "
"and signals an event:"
msgstr ""
"第三個頂層任務會與擷取迴圈以及 HTTP "
"伺服器並行執行。它會等待每個新影格、對前一影格執行差異運算，並——當變化超過所設定的閾值時——遞增一個計數器並發出一個事件訊號："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/events.rst:41
msgid ""
"The ``compute_change`` implementation is out of scope for this chapter -- "
"the image-processing section covers frame-differencing properly. For now "
"treat it as a placeholder that returns a number."
msgstr ""
"``compute_change`` 的實作不在本章範圍內——影像處理一節會妥善涵蓋影格差異運算。目前先把它當作一個回傳數字的佔位實作即可。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/events.rst:45
msgid "Add the new task to ``main``:"
msgstr "把這個新任務加入 ``main``\\ ："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/events.rst:57
msgid "The /events route"
msgstr "/events 路由"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/events.rst:59
msgid ""
":func:`microdot.sse.with_sse` decorates an async handler so microdot "
"performs the SSE handshake (status 200, ``Content-Type: text/event-stream``,"
" no buffering) and hands the handler an :class:`~microdot.sse.SSE` object. "
"The handler stays awake for as long as the browser keeps the connection "
"open:"
msgstr ""
":func:`microdot.sse.with_sse` 會裝飾一個非同步處理常式，使 microdot 執行 SSE 交握（狀態 200、\\ "
"``Content-Type: text/event-stream``\\ 、不緩衝），並把一個 :class:`~microdot.sse.SSE` "
"物件交給處理常式。只要瀏覽器保持連線開啟，處理常式就會一直保持喚醒："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/events.rst:81
msgid ""
":meth:`~microdot.sse.SSE.send` writes one event to the wire and yields back "
"to the event loop. ``event='motion'`` names the event type so the browser-"
"side ``EventSource`` can register a listener for just that name. "
"``event_id=`` (not shown) sets the ``id:`` line so the browser can resume "
"from a known offset on reconnect via the ``Last-Event-ID`` header."
msgstr ""
":meth:`~microdot.sse.SSE.send` 會把一個事件寫到傳輸線路上，並讓出控制權回到事件迴圈。\\ "
"``event='motion'`` 為事件型別命名，這樣瀏覽器端的 ``EventSource`` 就能只為該名稱註冊一個監聽器。\\ "
"``event_id=``\\ （未顯示）會設定 ``id:`` 那一行，讓瀏覽器在重新連線時可透過 ``Last-Event-ID`` "
"標頭從已知的偏移量處繼續。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/events.rst:88
msgid ""
"The 15-second timeout + ``comment=True`` send is the keep-alive trick. "
"Comment lines start with ``:`` and the browser ignores them entirely, but "
"the bytes moving over the wire stop intermediate proxies and NAT boxes from "
"killing an idle connection."
msgstr ""
"15 秒逾時搭配 ``comment=True`` 的傳送是維持連線的訣竅。註解行以 ``:`` "
"開頭，瀏覽器會完全忽略它們，但這些在傳輸線路上移動的位元組可阻止中間的代理伺服器與 NAT 裝置切斷閒置的連線。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/events.rst:94
msgid "The dashboard consumes events"
msgstr "儀表板消費事件"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/events.rst:96
msgid "Add this to ``app.js``:"
msgstr "把這段加入 ``app.js``\\ ："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/events.rst:110
msgid ""
"The browser opens one persistent HTTP connection to ``/events`` and re-opens"
" it automatically on any disconnect. Every ``motion`` event the cam pushes "
"appears as a new ``<li>`` at the top of the list."
msgstr ""
"瀏覽器會對 ``/events`` 開啟一個持續性的 HTTP 連線，並在任何斷線時自動重新開啟它。相機推播的每一個 ``motion`` "
"事件都會作為一個新的 ``<li>`` 出現在清單的最上方。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/webservers/events.rst:114
msgid "The owner now sees motion events the instant they fire."
msgstr "擁有者現在會在動作觸發的瞬間就看到動作事件。"
